meta {
  name: Get Today's Daily Log
  type: http
  seq: 3
}

get {
  url: {{baseURL}}/v1/house/:house/young-persons/:youngPerson/daily-logs/today
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:path {
  youngPerson: 1
  house: 1
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{token}}
}

docs {
  # Get Today's Daily Log
  
  Retrieves today's daily log for a specific young person with all activities.
  
  ## Path Parameters
  - `houseId` (integer, required): The house ID
  - `youngPersonId` (integer, required): The young person ID
  
  ## Response
  Returns today's daily log with:
  - `id`: Daily log ID
  - `date`: Log date (today's date)
  - `status`: Status (Pending, Approved, Rejected)
  - `chronology_id`: Chronology type ID reference
  - `chronology`: Chronology details (id, name)
  - `young_person`: Young person details (id, first_name, middle_name, last_name)
  - `house`: House details (id, house_name)
  - `performer`: User who performed approval/rejection (if applicable)
  - `creator`: User who created the log
  - `updater`: User who last updated the log
  - `remarks`: Approval remarks (if approved)
  - `reason`: Rejection reason (if rejected)
  - `activities`: Array of daily log activities with:
    - Activity details (day_part, log_date_time, chronology_id, etc.)
    - Chronology details (id, name)
    - Creator and updater user details
    - Attachments (if any)
  - `created_at`: Creation timestamp
  - `updated_at`: Last update timestamp
  
  ## Notes
  - Returns `null` if no daily log exists for today
  - Includes all activities sorted by log_date_time (ascending)
  - Only returns logs for the authenticated user's client
  - Requires `view_daily_logs` permission
}
